---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Security" description="Artometrics security practices and vulnerability disclosure." path="/security">
  <article class="wrap wrap--narrow page prose">
    <p class="kicker">Trust</p>
    <h1>Security</h1>
    <p>Membership data, billing webhooks, and editorial assets stay off the public bundle. This static host has no service-role keys and no secrets in the repository.</p>
    <h2>Practices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>TLS on the hosting edge</li>
      <li>Supabase Auth for saved reports and member audio, when the member API is attached</li>
      <li>Stripe webhook signature verification on the server, not in the page</li>
      <li>No service-role keys in the browser bundle</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Disclosure</h2>
    <p>Report vulnerabilities to <a href="mailto:security@artometrics.com">security@artometrics.com</a>. See also <a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy</a> and <a href="/legal/dpa">DPA</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
